, {"text": "Duty officer Stanislav Petrov had protocol orders to report the attack immediately, which would have triggered a full nuclear retaliation.", "s": 18.166, "e": 28.401}, {"text": "Trusting his gut that a real US first strike wouldn't use just five missiles, he declared it a false alarm, and was right; sunlight reflecting off clouds had tricked the satellite.", "s": 28.521, "e": 41.136}]}